chip ymf278b
clock 33868800
samples 26000
mem pcm wavetable.bin
# The FM side beside the PCM: an FM voice to outputs A and B, mixed into
# DO2 with the PCM; one to C and D, which leave on DO0 unmixed; one in the
# second bank; a 4-operator voice; with the FM mix control (0xF8) at every
# value, and PCM voices on DO2 and DO1. The FM engine runs at 19*36 clocks
# a sample, so it is clocked a second time on 21 samples in 171.
0 w 2 05 3 03  # NEW and NEW2: OPL4 mode
0 w 0 20 1 01 0 40 1 20 0 60 1 f2 0 80 1 13 0 23 1 01 0 43 1 00 0 63 1 f2 0 83 1 13 0 c0 1 36 0 a0 1 00 0 b0 1 32  # FM ch 0 to A and B
0 w 0 21 1 01 0 41 1 20 0 61 1 f2 0 81 1 13 0 24 1 01 0 44 1 00 0 64 1 f2 0 84 1 13 0 c1 1 c6 0 a1 1 81 0 b1 1 35  # FM ch 1 to C and D
0 w 4 20 5 00 4 38 5 02 4 50 5 01 4 08 5 02 4 68 5 80  # PCM ch 0 on DO2
0 w 4 21 5 00 4 39 5 04 4 51 5 01 4 09 5 01 4 69 5 90  # PCM ch 1 on DO1
2000 w 4 f8 5 07  # FM mix right 0, left 7
3000 w 4 f8 5 0e  # FM mix right 1, left 6
4000 w 4 f8 5 15  # FM mix right 2, left 5
5000 w 4 f8 5 1c  # FM mix right 3, left 4
6000 w 4 f8 5 23  # FM mix right 4, left 3
7000 w 4 f8 5 2a  # FM mix right 5, left 2
8000 w 4 f8 5 31  # FM mix right 6, left 1
9000 w 4 f8 5 38  # FM mix right 7, left 0
10000 w 4 f8 5 1b
10000 w 2 22 3 01 2 42 3 20 2 62 3 f2 2 82 3 13 2 25 3 01 2 45 3 00 2 65 3 f2 2 85 3 13 2 c2 3 16 2 a2 3 a0 2 b2 3 2e  # FM ch 11 (second bank) to A
12000 w 0 b0 1 08 0 b1 1 08  # FM ch 0 and 1 off
13000 w 2 04 3 01  # 4-operator mode on channels 0 and 3
13000 w 0 20 1 01 0 23 1 02 0 28 1 01 0 2b 1 01 0 40 1 10 0 43 1 18 0 48 1 14 0 4b 1 00 0 60 1 f3 0 63 1 f3 0 68 1 f3 0 6b 1 f3 0 80 1 24 0 83 1 24 0 88 1 24 0 8b 1 24 0 c0 1 31 0 c3 1 30 0 a0 1 44 0 b0 1 32
17000 w 0 b0 1 12
17000 w 4 68 5 00 4 69 5 00
